---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_timing: authorized
    q_check_timing --> q_check_not_published: refundEndTime < now
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: refund period not ended
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_check_not_published --> q_set_roots: results not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert_published: already published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_set_roots --> q_set_totals: set claimMerkleRoot, acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
    q_set_totals --> [*]: set totalTokensAllocated, tokenDecimals, emit ResultsPublished

    note right of q_set_roots
        INV-001: results can only be published once
        INV-002: results can only be published after refund period ends
        INV-003: only Legion operators can publish results
        INV-004: claimMerkleRoot != bytes32(0)
    end note
